  "bodyHtml": "\n\n\t\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2017-07-16T16:14:04-04:00\" title=\"Sunday, July 16, 2017, 4:14 pm\">July 16, 2017</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-content\">\n\t\t\t<h3>Award winning Harwich Artist, Larry Folding, demonstrates for a full house at Meet The Artist</h3>\n<figure id=\"attachment_3178\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img class=\"size-full wp-image-3178\" src=\"/media/archive/7aefb6932c2c7ce53e3e4292497e6b9e54047771e609fdd914cd16fe86a10ee3.jpg\" alt=\"Larry Folding demonstrating his watercolor process at Meet The Artist on July 15. ©Guild of Harwich Artists\" width=\"640\" height=\"480\" loading=\"lazy\" /><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-3178\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Larry Folding demonstrating his watercolor process at Meet The Artist on July 15. ©Guild of Harwich Artists</figcaption></figure>\n<p>Completing a half sheet painting from start to finish using wet into wet and wet onto dry techniques, <a href=\"/artists/larry-folding/\">Folding</a> took questions from the audience.</p>\n<p>“Capturing the Cape’s light, especially in the spring and fall when the air is clear, is something I continually endeavor to do. The light is ever changing. Long shadows form and move endlessly, as your brain and camera’s eye try to absorb as much information about the landscape as possible.”</p>\n<figure id=\"attachment_3177\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img class=\"size-full wp-image-3177\" src=\"/media/archive/2cdd47e8fc5c6b24a884e1218d4d957f9bf2ba3fa4e115b80e995edf53f4b0e1.jpg\" alt=\"Larry Folding demonstrating his watercolor process at Meet The Artist on July 15. ©Guild of Harwich Artists\" width=\"640\" height=\"480\" loading=\"lazy\" /><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-3177\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Larry Folding demonstrating his watercolor process at Meet The Artist on July 15. ©Guild of Harwich Artists</figcaption></figure>\n<figure id=\"attachment_3175\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img class=\"size-full wp-image-3175\" src=\"/media/archive/3f3eb0d941611dc4a31772727e888434060a5c8e1ceda43030fffda6ec0f2af5.jpg\" alt=\"Larry Folding demonstrating his watercolor process at Meet The Artist on July 15. ©Guild of Harwich Artists\" width=\"640\" height=\"480\" loading=\"lazy\" /><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-3175\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Larry Folding demonstrating his watercolor process at Meet The Artist on July 15. ©Guild of Harwich Artists</figcaption></figure>\n<p>The Art Gallery, 551 Main Street (Rte. 28) in Harwich Port. Free public parking at the Harwich Chamber of Commerce Tourist Information Center.</p>\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t<footer class=\"entry-footer\">\n\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-terms category\">Posted in <a href=\"/archive/source-24848e4ea0af8641d360/\" rel=\"tag\">EDUCATION</a>, <a href=\"/archive/source-74004cd9be5de0d40a61/\" rel=\"tag\">EVENTS</a>, <a href=\"/archive/source-a2dd2a8b0cc8efdccc38/\" rel=\"tag\">MEET THE ARTIST</a>, <a href=\"/archive/source-3b7a7197884c65093e45/\" rel=\"tag\">THE ART GALLERY</a>, <a href=\"/archive/source-bc2e4bef39a39f9eb9e9/\" rel=\"tag\">THE ART GALLERY ARTISTS</a></span>\t\t\t<br /><span class=\"entry-terms post_tag\">Tagged <a href=\"/archive/source-95692369e68e1fd966d5/\" rel=\"tag\">Harwich Port</a>, <a href=\"/archive/source-0f38b00007a5ec9728b6/\" rel=\"tag\">Larry Folding</a>, <a href=\"/archive/source-b9ab081a4bc798f19819/\" rel=\"tag\">The Art Gallery of The Guild of Harwich Artists</a>, <a href=\"/archive/source-4eb958c8ea474845bb0f/\" rel=\"tag\">The Guild of Harwich Artists</a>, <a href=\"/archive/source-a78c41d2215f142284bf/\" rel=\"tag\">The Warm Side of the Cape</a></span>\t\t</footer>\n\n\t\n",
